window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Earth is gone, and humanity has been scattered across a multiverse they didn't even know existed.</b></p> <p>The only way to survive is to become powerful enough to fight back against the god-like forces that seek to control everything in the universe.</p> <p>Elder Realms<i> is the third book in the Path of Celestial Ascension series, a LitRPG adventure full of monsters, loot, leveling up, and a celestial engine that grants anyone near immortality if they can survive all the monsters... and each other. If you enjoy stories like Defiance of the Fall, Primal Hunter, or any of the countless other LitRPG adventures that have become fan favorites, be sure to check out the Path of Celestial Ascension.</i></p>"; 
